---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  description="Learn more about Leon Lin — background, beliefs, interests, and how to connect."
  includePerson={true}
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <!-- Bio -->
  <section class="bio">
    <p>
      I've spent my career moving between finance and technology: investment
      banking at JPMorgan, public-market investing at a Tiger Cub, early-stage
      startups, Uber, and Dropbox. I also build software and AI systems of my
      own.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Why I Write -->
  <section class="why">
    <h2>Why I Write</h2>
    <p>
      Writing forces me to clarify my thinking. It helps me understand what I
      believe, find the gaps in my reasoning, and share ideas that might be
      useful to other people.
    </p>
    <p>
      Over time, it has also been one of the best ways I've found to meet
      interesting people and stumble into opportunities I wouldn't have found
      otherwise.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Beliefs -->
  <section class="beliefs">
    <h2>What I believe in</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Compare yourself only to your past self.</li>
      <li>Chase excellence in the things that matter to you.</li>
      <li>Stay curious, and open to new ideas.</li>
      <li>You will fail. What matters more is what you do after that.</li>
      <li>Take more risks.</li>
      <li>Be clear about what you know and what you don’t.</li>
      <li>Do what you said you're going to do.</li>
      <li>Be kind to yourself and others, but don't be slack.</li>
      <li>Be selective with who you spend time with.</li>
      <li>
        Improve your process to make better decisions and get better outcomes.
      </li>
      <li>
        The world is mostly noise and not signal, and you are easily fooled by
        randomness.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Interests -->
  <section class="interests">
    <h2>Interests</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <b>Movement</b>: Ballet, Calisthenics, Dance, Flexibility, Gymnastics,
        Handbalancing, Judo, Weightlifting
      </li>
      <li><b>Lifestyle</b>: Art, Chocolate, Community, Food, Wine</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Advisory -->
  <section class="advisory">
    <h2>Advisory</h2>
    <p>
      I occasionally advise investors, founders, and companies on difficult
      questions involving markets, technology, strategy, and capital allocation.
      I focus on situations where judgment matters more than execution.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Investing -->
  <section class="investing">
    <h2>Angel Investing</h2>
    <p>
      I invest selectively in early-stage companies, usually pre-Series A, when
      I understand the business, believe in the economics, and think I can be
      useful beyond providing capital.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      The best way to reach me is by email: contact@leonlins.com. I’m
      rarely on social media.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
